# Only the projects the relay is built from go into the image's build (the context is the repository's root, whose
# classic game files and models have nothing to do with it). Docker reads this file for the Dockerfile beside it.
*
!Directory.Build.props
!import/Machines.Import
!sim/Machines.Sim
!net/Machines.Net
!server/Machines.Relay
**/bin
**/obj
